'''turnverein''' (törn′fe-rīn′), ''n.'' [G. ''turn-verein'', < ''turnen'', practise gymnastics (see ''turn'', ''turner''), + ''verein'', union, association, < ''ver-'', E. ''for-'', + ''ein'', one, = E. ''one''.] An association for the practice of gymnastics according to the system of the turners. See ''turner''<sup>1</sup>, 4.

